{"4401980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ashes of Darkness", "steam_appid": 4401980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4812080], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ashes of Darkness</strong> is a soulslike action game set in the Middle Ages. You play as a knight venturing into devastated lands shaped by the fall of an ancient kingdom and an ever-present sense of danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story is told subtly through the environment, enemies, and the few characters still clinging to life. Nothing is explained outright; the world slowly reveals itself as you explore and push forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4401980/extras/ce35ac2254ea2cbe6d020e1345b05464.poster.avif?t=1781875250\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4401980/extras/ce35ac2254ea2cbe6d020e1345b05464.webm?t=1781875250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4401980/extras/ce35ac2254ea2cbe6d020e1345b05464.mp4?t=1781875250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat focuses on positioning, pacing, and reading enemy behavior. You can attack, dodge, and use abilities, with parrying available as an optional, high-risk tool. Parries are not required, but they reward precise timing and knowledge of enemy patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4401980/extras/7997eb73c0e3ed2e9caa489fdf343cfc.poster.avif?t=1781875250\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4401980/extras/7997eb73c0e3ed2e9caa489fdf343cfc.webm?t=1781875250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4401980/extras/7997eb73c0e3ed2e9caa489fdf343cfc.mp4?t=1781875250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, character growth becomes essential. Defeating enemies and bosses allows you to improve attributes, unlock abilities, and equip artifacts that directly affect how you fight, letting you shape your own playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4401980/extras/ea08debf77fbabc164036d73c497d217.poster.avif?t=1781875250\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4401980/extras/ea08debf77fbabc164036d73c497d217.webm?t=1781875250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4401980/extras/ea08debf77fbabc164036d73c497d217.mp4?t=1781875250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a 2D pixel art style and a dark medieval atmosphere, <strong>Ashes of Darkness</strong> aims to deliver a challenging yet fair experience focused on steady progression and mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4401980/extras/6866a9fe59350dd194a53c0b07bf1797.poster.avif?t=1781875250\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4401980/extras/6866a9fe59350dd194a53c0b07bf1797.webm?t=1781875250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4401980/extras/6866a9fe59350dd194a53c0b07bf1797.mp4?t=1781875250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ashes of Darkness</strong> is a soulslike action game set in the Middle Ages. You play as a knight venturing into devastated lands shaped by the fall of an ancient kingdom and an ever-present sense of danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story is told subtly through the environment, enemies, and the few characters still clinging to life. Nothing is explained outright; the world slowly reveals itself as you explore and push forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4401980/extras/ce35ac2254ea2cbe6d020e1345b05464.poster.avif?t=1781875250\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4401980/extras/ce35ac2254ea2cbe6d020e1345b05464.webm?t=1781875250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4401980/extras/ce35ac2254ea2cbe6d020e1345b05464.mp4?t=1781875250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat focuses on positioning, pacing, and reading enemy behavior. You can attack, dodge, and use abilities, with parrying available as an optional, high-risk tool. Parries are not required, but they reward precise timing and knowledge of enemy patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4401980/extras/7997eb73c0e3ed2e9caa489fdf343cfc.poster.avif?t=1781875250\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4401980/extras/7997eb73c0e3ed2e9caa489fdf343cfc.webm?t=1781875250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.st